  m_Name: Contract_TorrentWyrmBounty
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::BeastClad.Data.GuildContractSO
  contractId: bounty_torrent_wyrm
  contractTitle: 'Wilderness Bounty: Torrent Wyrm'
  clientName: Guildmaster Vane
  description: A research institute requires a fresh, live Torrent Wyrm specimen from the quarantined wilderness clearing. Use Hydro pheromone bait [1] to lure it into a heavy wire snare [2].
  targetSpecies: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9ed6f1c7909783c41ad8b28f9337a3d1, type: 2}
  requiredCount: 1
  rewardCredits: 250
  rewardSummary: 250 Credits + Outpost Guild Seal
  dialogueBriefing: Greetings, trapper. The Institute needs a live Torrent Wyrm for hydro-conduction studies. Deploy your Hydro pheromones [1] near the pools and snare one alive [2]. Don't let it tear you apart.
  dialogueInProgress: Still tracking? Remember to place the Hydro scent lure [1] to pull the Wyrm out into the open, then drop a heavy wire snare [2] right in its path. Subdue it [E] once it's tangled!
  dialogueCompleted: Remarkable work, trapper! That specimen is pristine. Here's your 250 Credits as promised. The Guild respects clean, non-lethal work.
